--
--   Description
--
-- This test is intended to cover the receive functionality of the
-- GEM in gigabit operation when using the TBI (PCS layer) interface.
-- Full duplex operation is used throughout this test case. Output data
-- from the MAC is supplied via the external fifo interface.
-- 
-- Functional Coverage
----------------------
-- . Ensure the PCS correctly signals errors when EPD is wrong, and that MAC
--   RX marks the frame as a bad one. Also ensures that RX restarts correctly
--   after IFG.
--
--  
-- Detailed Test Description
----------------------------
--
-- The auto-negotiation function is disabled (using bit-7 of the PCS
-- Control Register) prior to selecting PCS. The PCS is selected
-- by setting the MAC into Gigabit mode and setting PCS enable in the
-- MAC network configuration register.
--
-- Corrupts EPD from 
--
-- Alignment:   | EVEN| ODD | EVEN| ODD | EVEN| ODD |
--		          +     +     +     +    -
--		/DXX.X/K29.7/K23.7/K23.7/K28.5/D5.6/
--		/DXX.X/  T  /  R  /  R  /    I1    /
-- to
--
--		/DXX.X/K29.7/K23.7/<CORRUPT>/K28.5/D5.6/
--		/DXX.X/  T  /  R  /<CORRUPT>/    I1    /
-- Where <CORRUPT> is
--	01 /K28.5/
--	02 /S/
--	03 /T/
--	04 /V/
--	05 /D16.2/
--	06 /D5.6/
--	07 /D2.2/
--	08 /D21.5/
--	09 /INVALID CG/
--	10 /OPPOSITE DISP CG/
--
-- and then to
--
--		/DXX.X/K29.7/<CORRUPT>/K23.7/K28.5/D5.6/
--		/DXX.X/  T  /<CORRUPT>/  R  /    I1    /
--	11 /K28.5/
--	12 /S/
--	13 /T/
--	14 /V/
--	15 /D16.2/
--	16 /D5.6/
--	17 /D2.2/
--	18 /D21.5/
--	19 /INVALID CG/
--	20 /OPPOSITE DISP CG/
--
-- and then to
--
--	21	/DXX.X/K23.7/K23.7/K23.7/K28.5/D5.6/
--		/DXX.X/  R  /  R  /  R  /    I1    /
--
-- Check the statistics registers.
--
-- 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------


pinsc(50) loopback 0 half_duplex 1  extint 0 speed 0 --  check reset state

-- check and initialise the relevant registers
apbrd(100) 00 00000000  -- check reset value of network control register
apbrd      04 00080000  -- check reset value of network config register
apbrd      08 00000006  -- check reset value of network status register
apbrd     200 00009040  -- check value of pcs control register
apbwr     200 00000040  -- disable autonegotioation
apbrd     200 00008040  -- check autoneg disabled
apbwr      04 00080c00  -- Put MAC into gigabit mode with TBI
apbrd      04 00080c00  -- Check value of network config register
apbwr      00 00000004  -- enable receive
apbrd      24 00000000  -- check interrupt status
apbwr      28 ffffffff  -- enable all interrupts
apbrd      24 00000000  -- check interrupt status
apbwr      88 03020100  -- specific address register 1 bottom
apbwr      8C 00000504  -- specific address register 1 top
apbrd     200 00000040  -- check autoneg disabled and reset clear

apbrd(int) 24 00000200  -- check link status change interrupt
apbrdf     20 00000000  -- check receive status register and trigger reception


